huanwen-return:chen:m0012","quote":"沈勁"},{"mention_id":"c-jinshu-089-shen-chuqian-shuren:p001:m0006","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-089-shen-chuqian-shuren:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-089-shen-chuqian-shuren","quote":"沈勁"},{"mention_id":"c-songshu-063-shenyanzhi-shuren:p001:m0031","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-063-shenyanzhi-shuren:p001","chapter_id":"c-songshu-063-shenyanzhi-shuren","quote":"勁"}],"identity_note":"卷八十九忠義本傳首稱字世堅、父充，與九十八充子勁字面相合。","review":"ai_provisional","family_path":{"connection":"father","parent_person_id":"4c2_19b_bf4","generation_distance":1,"source_assertion_id":"a-w098-shen-jing-chong","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-098","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-098-shenchong","source_id":"s-jinshu-098-shenchong","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-098-shenchong:line091","quote":"明帝將伐敦，遣其鄉人沈禎諭充，許以為司空。充謂禎曰：「三司具瞻之重，豈吾所任！幣厚言甘，古人所畏。且丈夫共事，終始當同，寧可中道改易，人誰容我！」禎曰：「不然。舍忠與順，未有不亡者也。大將軍阻兵不朝，爵賞自己，五尺之童知其異志。今此之舉，將行篡弑耳，豈同於往年乎？是以疆場諸將莫不歸赴本朝，內外之士咸願致死，正以移國易主，義不北面以事之也，奈何協同逆圖，當不義之責乎！朝廷坦誠，禎所知也。賊之黨類，猶宥其罪，與之更始，況見機而作邪！」充不納。率兵臨發，謂其妻子曰：「男兒不豎豹尾，終不還也。」及敗歸吳興，亡失道，誤入其故將吳儒家。儒誘充內重壁中，因笑謂充曰：「三千戶侯也。」充曰：「封侯不足貪也。爾以大義存我，我宗族必厚報汝。若必殺我，汝族滅矣。」儒遂殺之。充子勁竟滅吳氏。勁見《忠義傳》。","source_term":"充子勁"}],"interpretation_note":"父子在沈充傳末明載。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}},{"id":"4c2_19b_bf4_AA","label":"沈赤黔（沈勁子，沈叔任父）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"赤黔","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-089-shen-chuqian-shuren:p001:m0031","c-jinshu-089-shen-chuqian-shuren:p001:m0038","c-songshu-063-shenyanzhi-shuren:p001:m0068"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-jinshu-089-shen-chuqian-shuren:p001:m0031","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-089-shen-chuqian-shuren:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-089-shen-chuqian-shuren","quote":"赤黔"},{"mention_id":"c-jinshu-089-shen-chuqian-shuren:p001:m0038","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-089-shen-chuqian-shuren:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-089-shen-chuqian-shuren","quote":"赤黔"},{"mention_id":"c-songshu-063-shenyanzhi-shuren:p001:m0068","par